    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Choose content from Bizify.me and publish it in your WordPress posts and pages, using your own theme and layout.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add content with the block editor or Classic Editor.</li>\n<li>Automatically create posts from new uploads, including content created with the Bizify.me app.</li>\n<li>Choose the category, author and post status for imported posts.</li>\n<li>Create WordPress posts from previously uploaded content with Start import.</li>\n<li>Use separate account and import settings for each site in a multisite network.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Sign in or create a Bizify.me account directly from WordPress, either when choosing content or connecting your account.</p>\n<p>For automatic import, connect your account in Settings and enable the feature.</p>\n<h3>The Bizify.me service</h3>\n<p>Bizify.me hosts your content and handles purchases, playback and downloads.</p>\n<p>The plugin connects to Bizify.me when you connect your account, choose or import content, and when visitors browse your website.</p>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://www.bizify.me\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Bizify.me website</a> for features, payment options and fees. Read our <a href=\"https://www.bizify.me/privacy-policy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Privacy &amp; Security</a> policy.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install and activate Bizify.me in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Add the Bizify.me block, or click Add Bizify.me content in Classic Editor.</li>\n<li>Sign in or create an account, then choose the content to insert.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>For automatic import, open Bizify.me <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Settings, connect your account and enable Auto import objects. Choose your sources and post settings, then click Save Changes.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.7.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add block editor support while retaining Classic Editor and existing shortcodes.</li>\n<li>Simplify account connection and add per-site multisite settings.</li>\n<li>Improve imports, duplicate checks, progress reporting and error handling.</li>\n<li>Improve compatibility, responsive media, fullscreen playback, security and translations.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Full release notes are preserved in changelog.txt.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Sell photos, videos and digital downloads on your WordPress website.",
    "description": "<p>Choose content from Bizify.me and publish it in your WordPress posts and pages, using your own theme and layout.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add content with the block editor or Classic Editor.</li>\n<li>Automatically create posts from new uploads, including content created with the Bizify.me app.</li>\n<li>Choose the category, author and post status for imported posts.</li>\n<li>Create WordPress posts from previously uploaded content with Start import.</li>\n<li>Use separate account and import settings for each site in a multisite network.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Sign in or create a Bizify.me account directly from WordPress, either when choosing content or connecting your account.</p>\n<p>For automatic import, connect your account in Settings and enable the feature.</p>\n<h3>The Bizify.me service</h3>\n<p>Bizify.me hosts your content and handles purchases, playback and downloads.</p>\n<p>The plugin connects to Bizify.me when you connect your account, choose or import content, and when visitors browse your website.</p>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://www.bizify.me\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Bizify.me website</a> for features, payment options and fees. Read our <a href=\"https://www.bizify.me/privacy-policy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Privacy &amp; Security</a> policy.</p>\n",
    "download_link": "https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/bizifyme.1.7.0.zip",
    "upgrade_notice": {
        "1.7.0": "<p>Requires WordPress 6.4 or later and PHP 7.4 or later. Existing saved content and account settings are retained.</p>"
    },
